    count: 19-56 objects, sizes 1-8 pixels, bbox at most 3x3
    pixel_fraction: 18-35%
  background: 17-23% of pixels [observed]
  symmetry: normalized grid (teal -> source_color) is transpose-symmetric (grid == grid.T) [observed]
  wallpaper: the row-type sequence and column-type sequence are identical (consequence of transpose symmetry)
  teal_templates:
